* File Upload work

 - db.init_owner_table() -> int SUCCESS/FAIL
   - table_exist() returns bool
   - Create if not exist
     - run_db_commit()
     - wrtie test


 - db.init_chunk_table() -> int SUCCESS/FAIL
   - table_exist() returns bool
     - Create if not exist
       - run_db_commit()


  - db.write_owner_table_entry() int:SUCCESS/FAIL 
    - table_exist() return bool
      - yes/No: init_owner_table()
      - Check if entry exists:
      - run_db_fetch()
      - YES/NO: write_owner_entry()


  - db.write_chunk() - [number, chunk]
        - chunk_number_exist() - return bool
        - exists: return error
          - !exists: db.write_chunk()

  - upload()
    db.write_chunk(number chunk)

  - c_upload()
	- calc_num_chunks()
	- for num in num_chunks:
       chunk = get_chunk(file, num)
       bchunk = enc_chunk()
       upload(number, bchunk, channel)
    - send_upload_to_users(md5, key,)



